# tools/globals.generated.json is rewritten by tools/symbols.mjs on every
# `npm run lint`, and Node writes LF. With core.autocrlf=true (the default on
# Windows checkouts) git expects CRLF in the working tree, so it reported the
# file as permanently modified even though `git diff` showed no content change
# — leaving the tree dirty after every lint run.
#
# Pinning it to LF makes the file git writes and the file the tool writes
# byte-identical. Deliberately scoped to this one generated artifact: a
# repo-wide `* text=auto` would renormalise every file in the project.
tools/globals.generated.json text eol=lf
